## Input and Output with Variables

### Output (Displaying Variables)

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int age = 25;
string name = "Alice";
double salary = 50000.50;

cout << "Name: " << name << endl;
cout << "Age: " << age << endl;
cout << "Salary: $" << salary << endl;

// Output:
// Name: Alice
// Age: 25
// Salary: $50000.50
```

### Input (Getting User Input)

```cpp
#include <iostream>
using namespace std;

int age;
string name;
double salary;

cout << "Enter your name: ";
cin >> name;  // Reads until space

cout << "Enter your age: ";
