1. Inheritance
2. Polymorphism
3. Virtual Functions
4. Abstract Classes and Pure Virtual Functions
5. Operator Overloading
6. Friend Functions and Friend Classes
7. Static Members
8. Multiple Inheritance
9. Practical Projects

