# 10. Prevention Techniques

## Write Tests

```cpp
#include <cassert>

// Test function
void testDivide() {
    assert(divide(10, 2) == 5);
    assert(divide(10, 5) == 2);
    assert(divide(0, 5) == 0);
    // Test edge cases
    try {
        divide(10, 0);
        assert(false);  // Should throw
    } catch (const invalid_argument&) {
        // Expected
    }
}

int main() {
    testDivide();
    cout << "All tests passed!" << endl;
    return 0;
}
```

