## Initialize Everything

```cpp
// ✅ Initialize in constructor
class Student {
private:
    string name;
    int age;
    double gpa;

public:
    Student() : name(""), age(0), gpa(0.0) {
        // All members initialized
    }
};

// ✅ Initialize local variables
