### Comparison Operator Summary

|Operator|Meaning|Example|Result (if a=5, b=3)|
|---|---|---|---|
|`==`|Equal to|`a == b`|false|
|`!=`|Not equal to|`a != b`|true|
|`>`|Greater than|`a > b`|true|
