## Token Pasting (##)

### Concatenating Tokens

```cpp
#define CONCAT(a, b) a##b

int main() {
    int CONCAT(var, 123) = 42;
    // Expands to: int var123 = 42;
    
    cout << CONCAT(var, 123) << endl;
    // Expands to: cout << var123 << endl
    // Output: 42
    
    return 0;
}
```

