## Platform-Specific Code

```cpp
#ifdef _WIN32
    #include <windows.h>
    void clearScreen() {
        system("cls");
    }
#elif defined(__linux__)
    #include <unistd.h>
    void clearScreen() {
        system("clear");
    }
